# HOME's knob pages: ALGO there steps DRONE, VOX, MOTION, SPACE, THROWS, MIX, ALIVE (round and round; kept
# across a power cut), the knobs each page's, drawn as arcs (screenshots in build/scenarios/home_pages/)
autoplay 0
wait 500
expect hpage 0
shot drone.png
# DRONE: SHAPE's DRONE page (FILTER, BODY, SWARM, WAVE)
turn K3 4
expect shape13 88
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 1
expect view 0
# VOX: the sound playing's BRIGHT, FILTER (VOX 2), RESO, RELEASE
turn K4 3
expect vs1.3 96
shot vox.png
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 2
# MOTION: the drone's SWEEP, RATE, DRIFT; TIDES
turn K3 5
expect dmotion3 35
shot motion.png
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 3
# SPACE: the reverb's return, its decay, shimmer, the delay's return (the FX page's)
turn K3 5
expect fx2 35
shot space.png
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 4
# THROWS: DIP (left a low-pass), WARP, FEEDBACK, FREEZE, left where they are set; FX held throws from there,
# and let go they drift back there, not to nothing
turn K1 -5
expect thr3 -20
turn K2 3
expect perf9 18
shot throws.png
press FX
turn K4 -5
expect thr3 -40
release FX
wait 3000
expect thr3 -20
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 5
# MIX: the parts' levels
turn K1 -5
expect shape10 90
shot mix.png
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 6
# ALIVE: steps; SWELLS how many drone voices come and go (all five in ECLIPSE: down to two, the top two)
turn K3 -3
expect dswell 24
turn K4 2
expect travel 2
shot alive.png
turn ALGO 1
expect hpage 0
turn ALGO -2
expect hpage 5
tap SAVE
powercut
wait 300
expect hpage 5
expect travel 2
expect dswell 24
